  "description": "Performance review of an AI agent: 14 files, 112 added, 16 removed, and a manager who has stopped reading. Insilode's Show Git Changes in Flow puts the whole change on one canvas: every endpoint the changed code reaches, cut down to the changed methods, added lines green and removed lines red. It shows what changed, not whether it is right. Demo project (Harbor Goods). The commit is staged for the demo. Real captures of Insilode, a code editor built on VS Code. Voice: synthetic (AI-generated). Music composed in code. Free and open source: insilode.dev",
